1
00:00:00,486 --> 00:00:01,576
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:01,577 --> 00:00:02,983
step in deeply to his rear

3
00:00:02,984 --> 00:00:04,216
controlling his arm

4
00:00:04,717 --> 00:00:05,795
as you bring him around,

5
00:00:06,096 --> 00:00:08,364
slide your hand around his wrist

6
00:00:08,365 --> 00:00:10,282
bring his wrist up to your shoulder,

7
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:11,602
as you do so

8
00:00:11,903 --> 00:00:13,553
move the other one to his wrist,

9
00:00:13,554 --> 00:00:14,446
then cut down

10
00:00:15,547 --> 00:00:16,305
turn,

11
00:00:16,306 --> 00:00:17,965
place Uke down in front of you

12
00:00:18,766 --> 00:00:22,587
come back to the front
placing his shoulder in between your knees,

13
00:00:22,588 --> 00:00:24,842
controlling his wrist tightly against your body

14
00:00:24,843 --> 00:00:27,721
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

